@startuml revoke-and-unbind
!theme plain
title Ending access: grant revocation, task end, account revocation

actor "Person / operator" as P
participant "Dispatcher" as D
participant "curator-host-helper" as H
participant "Broker" as B

== a grant is revoked ==
P -> B: revocation.put {revokes: G_child, by: issuer, sig}
B -> B: the next lease or renew under that chain → lease_grant_revoked

== the task ends ==
D -> B: unbind {uid 612}
B -> B: release open leases of uid 612
D -> H: helper-op/1 {op: user.remove, username: cur-a-dev-7f3}
H --> D: removed (only accounts the helper created)
note over B: a recycled UID cannot inherit the binding:\nleases re-check the helper ledger generation

== the account is withdrawn ==
P -> B: account.revoke {account: ivan/claude/personal}
B -> B: delete the material; state = revoked; every lease → lease_account_revoked
P -> P: revoke at the vendor (claude.ai for Claude, codex logout for Codex)
@enduml
